Du singst: Voronwe mordo cala ar metta andune,||Du singst: Laitielya rahtale numen ar menel tanya,||Du singst: Lire nai nai cara i lieva cenuvalye,||Du singst: Nai i hresta ar hantalya corma tulca.
@WER singt: Voronwe mordo cala ar metta andune,||@WER singt: Laitielya rahtale numen ar menel tanya,||@WER singt: Lire nai nai cara i lieva cenuvalye,||@WER singt: Nai i hresta ar hantalya corma tulca.
--
Du singst: I elenillor tilye, i isil sise,||Du singst: Coa nai lindenna, an coivenya calma.||Du singst: I herindor lumenna, i umbar lertalya,||Du singst: Nai i laita lomissen lyenna sila nai.
@WER singt: I elenillor tilye, i isil sise,||@WER singt: Coa nai lindenna, an coivenya calma.||@WER singt: I herindor lumenna, i umbar lertalya,||@WER singt: Nai i laita lomissen lyenna sila nai.
--
Du singst: Aiya, i lire, ya coivanen ilqua,||Du singst: Mahtie i cara, laitie i more.||Du singst: I lire nai i laita cilme, sule quenya ar melda,||Du singst: Ilya i sinoma, turien ar lissenen vilya.
@WER singt: Aiya, i lire, ya coivanen ilqua,||@WER singt: Mahtie i cara, laitie i more.||@WER singt: I lire nai i laita cilme, sule quenya ar melda,||@WER singt: Ilya i sinoma, turien ar lissenen vilya.
--
Du singst: I lyndi lertalya, i quelindi cante,||Du singst: I lyanda nertalma, i angilinde ar tyelma.||Du singst: I laure canta nai, i lasselini taltuva,||Du singst: Ilya i coiva nai i lire, tulca cirya lumeva.
