--
Du singst: Hantalye tulcavelya, iluva i vanya ar aranya,||Du singst: Ilya i lire tyania, coar hantalma nai noto.||Du singst: I cuile i cormar, i coivalda nai linde corma,||Du singst: Ilya i sinoma noretelma, i coivanen tya melme.
